   "span_start": 12
  },
  {
   "id": "2:66",
   "text": "That's where most of our team works, and it's important that we foster a collaborative environment.",
   "key": "new:2:66",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 2,
   "span_start": 66
  },
  {
   "id": "3:74",
   "text": "It's important to include assert statements in your methods to validate input and ensure that your code behaves as expected.",
   "key": "new:3:74",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 74
  },
  {
   "id": "3:199",
   "text": "Remember to always include them.",
   "key": "new:3:199",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 3,
   "span_start": 199
  },
  {
   "id": "5:57",
   "text": "Don't hesitate to reach out if you need anything at all.",
   "key": "new:5:57",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 5,
   "span_start": 57
  },
  {
   "id": "7:77",
   "text": "From now on, I'd like you to use the common area for your work.",
   "key": "new:7:77",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 77
  },
  {
   "id": "7:141",
   "text": "It's important for your growth within the team and the company.",
   "key": "new:7:141",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 7,
   "span_start": 141
  },
  {
   "id": "8:0",
   "text": "That way, you're more visible and approachable.",
   "key": "new:8:0",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 0
  },
  {
   "id": "8:48",
   "text": "It's also a great way to foster collaboration and a sense of community.",
   "key": "new:8:48",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 8,
   "span_start": 48
  },
  {
   "id": "9:82",
   "text": "Always add comments to your Python scripts.",
   "key": "new:9:82",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 9,
   "span_start": 82
  },
  {
   "id": "9:126",
   "text": "It's crucial for code documentation and understanding, especially when others review your work.",
   "key": "new:9:126",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 9,
   "span_start": 126
  },
  {
   "id": "10:6",
   "text": "Don't hesitate to reach out if you have any questions or concerns.",
   "key": "new:10:6",
   "scope": "MAIN",
   "kind": "all",
   "version": 1,
   "status": "live",
   "provenance_turn": 10,
   "span_start": 6
  },
  {
   "id": "11:11",
